  "description": "ASP.NET Core companion for Cayaqui.BuildingBlocks: maps Result<T>/DomainError to RFC7807 ProblemDetails by ErrorType, provides a global IExceptionHandler (500 + traceId) and AddMpsErrorHandling DI wiring. Requires a commercial agreement with Cayaqui.",
